ny times before they hit their  big idea  and so all this time while you're  experimenting you're losing money  because you have to pay back this bank  loan  if you want to get started i'd say  bootstrap find a way to get it started  without spending any money start it as a  service if you need to get close to your  customers learn what they need learn how  you can help them instead of going into  personal debt to get this company  launched  another great way to do it is to get a  job  go work for somebody and don't just get  a job to make money get a job to learn  the reason why you get a job is to learn  you work to learn i have an entire zuga  guide that's dedicated to working to  learn this break down all the steps on  how to do it but basically you want to  find somebody who has done what you want  to do who's accomplished what you want  to accomplish and go work for them you  get paid so you're not worried about you  know paying your bills you're getting  paid to learn you're making industry  contacts you're making mistakes while  getting paid it's like going to  university but getting paid to do it  you're making contacts so that when you  launch your business you already know  what you're doing you don't need the  money you can line up clients  that's the better way to do it and to  fund it than to go into debt and take on  a personal loan to launch  so maybe not the answer you wanted to  hear  but that's my advice  believe those who watch like the video  thumbs up below let me know what you  think let me know if you've gone to the  bank and tried to get funding and were  accepted or rejected your experiences  leave it in the comment section below  you have a question for me leave it  below too i'll make a video response  just like this and if you want to see  more videos like this click on my face  subscribe to the channel thank you so  much i'll see you soon  you
 

